---

  <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked&nbsp;Questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-item active">
          <div class="faq-question">
            <span>What age can my child begin training?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Children can start as early as age 5 in our Youth Wrestling Academy. At this age, curriculum focuses on agility, tumbling, balance, basic stances, and listening discipline in an engaging, supportive environment.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question">
            <span>What gear does my child need for their 3-day trial?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            For the 3-day trial pass, your child just needs comfortable athletic shorts (without zippers or pockets) and a t-shirt. Wrestling shoes are recommended but socks are acceptable for their first trial days. We provide loaner headgear if needed. Arrive 15 minutes early for check-in and gear fitting, and call (510) 303-4869 to confirm your first session.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question">
            <span>Are there contracts or cancellation fees?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            No. All memberships are flat $139.99 month-to-month. There are no initiation fees, no belt exam fees, and you may cancel or pause your membership anytime with 7 days advance notice before your billing cycle.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question">
            <span>Where is the gym located and which cities do you serve?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            United Wrestling Club is located at 30139 Industrial Pkwy SW Ste C, Hayward, CA 94544, easily accessible via I-880 and Highway 92. We serve families and competitors from Hayward, Union City, Fremont, Newark, Castro Valley, and San Leandro.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<style>
    .faq-section {
      padding: 52px 0;
      background-color: #0b0d11;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-default);
    }

    .faq-container {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 40px auto 0;
    }

    .faq-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default);
      background: var(--color-surface-1);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .faq-question {
      padding: 22px 26px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text-strong);
      user-select: none;
    }

    .faq-toggle {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--color-brand-text);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .faq-item.active .faq-toggle {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      max-width: 68ch;
      padding: 0 26px 22px;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: none;
    }

    .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
      display: block;
    }

